   "notes": [
    "Spellslinger B2 plus the best Izzet cards from the old Inalla list (Inalla deleted Nov 19, 2026). About $6 on top of Spellslinger B2.",
    "Baral (Thought Vessel) and Kaza (Wayfarer's Bauble) make spells cheaper; Kaza counts every Wizard.",
    "Basalt Ravager (Expel from Orazca) and Firefist Adept (Planar Incision) deal damage equal to his Wizard count when they enter, twice with Naban. Ravager can hit a player.",
    "Tishana's Tidebinder (Unsummon) and Chaos Warp (Siren's Ruse) answer things the deck couldn't: abilities, enchantments, anything.",
    "Path of Ancestry (Myriad Landscape) scries when casting Wizards, since Gandalf is a Wizard.",
    "0 Game Changers, no 2-card infinites. One 5-card loop exists: Archaeomancer (or Shipwreck Dowser) + Displace + Storm-Kiln Artist + any two of Goblin Electromancer, Baral and Jace's Sanctum. Fine for Bracket 2, but don't build toward it.",
    "22 Wizards, 32 instants and sorceries."
